  "reference": "Ezra 8",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZR 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuatayo ni orodha ya viongozi wa koo za watu waliorudi pamoja nami Ezra",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ezra:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jina Ezra limeongezwa halimo katika Kiebrania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kutoka Babuloni, wakati wa utawala wa mfalme Artashasta: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gershomu, wa ukoo wa Finehasi. Danieli, wa ukoo wa Ithamari. Hatushi, wa ukoo wa Daudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aliyekuwa mwana wa Shekania. Zekaria, wa ukoo wa Paroshi, pamoja na wanaume 150 wa ukoo wake, walioandikishwa pamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliehoenai, mwana wa Zerahia, wa ukoo wa Pahath-moabu, pamoja na wanaume 200. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekania, mwana wa Yahazieli, wa ukoo wa Zatu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Zatu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania haina jina hili (taz pia 2:8).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pamoja na wanaume 300. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedi, mwana wa Yonathani, wa ukoo wa Adini, pamoja na wanaume 50. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshaya, mwana wa Athalia, wa ukoo wa Elamu, pamoja na wanaume 70. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebadia, mwana wa Mikaeli, wa ukoo wa Shefatia, pamoja na wanaume 80. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obadia, mwana wa Yehieli, wa ukoo wa Yoabu, pamoja na wanaume 218. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shelomithi, mwana wa Yosifia, wa ukoo wa Bani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jina hili halimo katika makala ya Kiebrania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pamoja na wanaume 160. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zekaria, mwana wa Bebai, wa ukoo wa Bebai, pamoja na wanaume 28. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohanani, mwana wa Hakatani, wa ukoo wa Azgadi, pamoja na watu 110. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elifeleti, Yeueli na Shemaya, wa ukoo wa Adonikamu, pamoja na wanaume 60, (hawa walirudi baadaye). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uthai na Zakuri, wa ukoo wa Bigwai, pamoja na wanaume 70.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niliwakusanya pamoja watu wote kando ya mto uelekeao mji wa Ahava. Huko, tulipiga kambi kwa muda wa siku tatu. Niliwakagua watu wote pamoja na makuhani, lakini sikupata Walawi miongoni mwao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niliita waje kwangu viongozi tisa: Eliezeri, Arieli, Shemaya, Elnathani, Yaribu, Elnathani, Nathani, Zekaria na Meshulamu, pamoja na waalimu wawili, Yoyaribu na Elnathani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikawatuma kwa Ido, kiongozi wa jamii ya watu kule Kasifia, nikimwomba yeye pamoja na wenzake wahudumu wa nyumba ya Mungu, watuletee watu watakaohudumu katika nyumba ya Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa neema yake Mungu, walituletea Sherebia, mtu mwenye busara na Mlawi wa ukoo wa Mahli, pamoja na wanawe na ndugu zake kumi na wanane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walituletea pia Hashabia na Yeshaya, wote wa ukoo wa Merari, pamoja na ndugu zao ishirini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbali na hao, kulikuwa na wahudumu wa hekalu 220 ambao babu zao walikuwa wamechaguliwa na mfalme Daudi na maofisa wake kuwasaidia Walawi. Majina ya watu wote hawa yaliorodheshwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, nilitoa maagizo kuwa sote tufike karibu na mto Ahava ili tufunge na kujinyenyekeza mbele za Mungu wetu na kumwomba atulinde na kutuongoza katika safari yetu pamoja na watoto wetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingekuwa aibu kubwa kwangu kumwomba mfalme kikosi cha askari na wapandafarasi wa kutulinda na adui njiani maana nilikuwa nimekwisha mwambia kuwa Mungu wetu huwabariki wote wanaomtafuta, lakini huwachukia na kuwaadhibu wote wanaomwacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo tulifunga na kumwomba Mungu atulinde, naye aliyasikia maombi yetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu kati ya makuhani waliokuwa viongozi nilichagua kumi na wawili: Sherebia, Hashabia pamoja na wenzao kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawa niliwapimia kwa mizani fedha, dhahabu na vyombo ambavyo mfalme, washauri wake, maofisa wake pamoja na watu wa Israeli walivyokuwa wamevitoa kwa ajili ya sadaka ya nyumba ya Mungu wetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivi ndivyo vitu nilivyowapimia: Fedha tani 22, vyombo 100 vya fedha, uzito wake kilo 70, dhahabu kilo 3400, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mabakuli 20 ya dhahabu, uzito wake kilo 8, vyombo viwili vya shaba nzuri iliyongaa yenye thamani kama ya dhahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha nikawaambia, “Nyinyi ni wakfu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu. Kadhalika vyombo ni wakfu na fedha na dhahabu ni matoleo ya hiari kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa babu zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tafadhali vilindeni na vitunzeni mpaka mtakapovipima mbele ya makuhani wakuu, Walawi na viongozi wa koo za Israeli, huko Yerusalemu katika vyumba vya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, makuhani na Walawi wakachukua fedha, dhahabu na vyombo vyote walivyopimiwa, ili kuvipeleka mjini Yerusalemu katika nyumba ya Mungu wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
