            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, watu wote waliorudi kutoka uhamishoni walimtolea Mungu wa Israeli sadaka zao za kuteketezwa. Walitoa mafahali 12 kwa ajili ya Israeli yote, kondoo madume 96 na wanakondoo 77; pia walitoa mbuzi 12 kama sadaka ya kuondoa dhambi. Wanyama wote hawa walitolewa kuwa sadaka ya kuteketezwa kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha, waliwakabidhi manaibu wa mfalme na watawala wa mkoa wa magharibi ya Eufrate mwongozo waliopewa na mfalme, nao walitoa msaada kwa watu na kwa ajili ya nyumba ya Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
